 - versioned `SimulationIR` and `ExecutionPackageIR` transport models for execution handoff
 - test, lint, type-check, and docs entrypoints
 
 ## Immediate Follow-On Work
 
-The next tasks extend the geometry layer into grouped or transformed composition, then
-move on to concrete grid, material, and runtime implementation work.
+The next tasks extend grid planning into `AutoGrid` and refinement metadata, then move
+into concrete material, boundary, and runtime implementation work.
