 decisions and the shared runtime-contract choice for later material-family tasks."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"Lorentz, Drude, and Debye can follow the same pattern: keep family-specific public and IR models, but lower onto the existing PoleResidue-family auxiliary-state runtime contract whenever the formulation permits it.","next_action":"none"}
