Diagonal anisotropic media are now threaded through the public API, IR, compilation, kernels, examples, README, and tests. Deferred surfaces for `FullyAnisotropicMedium` and direct `Medium2D` simulation use are explicit and validated.
  ✓ Inspect current repo state, task board, and existing material/runtime code relevant to anisotropy
  ✓ Implement anisotropic medium public/IR/compiler/kernel support plus explicit Medium2D policy
  ✓ Add tests/examples/docs, update working memory, and run focused verification
