 | `Absorber` | Implement | Important practical fallback |
-| `ABCBoundary` | Defer | Keep mapped |
-| `ModeABCBoundary` | Defer | Keep mapped |
+| `ABCBoundary` | Implement | First-order subset with explicit effective-medium inputs |
