phase1/logs/console.log:283803:phase1/runs/task-004-attempt-001/result.json:1:{"task_id":"task-004","status":"completed","summary":"Implemented checklist-aware core normalization and validation for the Phase 1 container layer, including primitive-shape sanity checks, simulation-bound validation, explicit unsupported-feature errors, normalize-index handling, zero-dimension boundary coercion, and supporting tests/docs.","key_findings":["Added `autofdtd.core.validation` as the shared normalization layer for tagged component payloads, covering name trimming, vector coercion, primitive geometry checks for `Box`/`Sphere`/`Cylinder`, structure-bound checks against the simulation domain, and zero-size-axis boundary coercion to `Periodic`.","`Simulation` now exposes explicit Phase 1 control-policy fields for `normalize_index`, `relax_courant`, `low_freq_smoothing`, and `lumped_elements`, with implemented validation for normalize-index and clear fail-fast errors for deferred or rejected core features.","Unsupported feature handling is now tied directly to the local feature matrix through lookup helpers in `autofdtd.planning`, so deferred and reject-clearly feature tags fail with explicit messages instead of being accepted silently or rejected as unknown extras.","Coverage now includes normalization, primitive shape errors, out-of-domain warnings and errors, zero-dimension absorbing-boundary coercion, normalize-index validation, and planning lookups, with docs and working memory updated to point later tasks at the shared validator path."],"artifacts":[{"path":"src/autofdtd/core/validation.py","description":"Shared Phase 1 validation and normalization helpers for tagged component payloads and simulation-bound checks."},{"path":"src/autofdtd/core/containers.py","description":"Integrated container-level validators for geometry, media, boundaries, normalize-index, and deferred-feature policies."},{"path":"src/autofdtd/planning.py","description":"Added feature lookup helpers and extra tracked Phase 1 feature tags used by validation."},{"path":"tests/test_containers.py","description":"Validation coverage for normalization, shape constraints, unsupported features, domain bounds, and zero-dimension boundary coercion."},{"path":"docs/architecture.md","description":"Architecture notes describing the new shared validation layer and its current responsibilities."},{"path":"phase1/working-memory.md","description":"Distilled task handoff notes for later feature-family tasks to reuse the core validation path."},{"path":"phase1/runs/task-004-attempt-001/result.json","description":"Structured task result artifact for this loop iteration."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"Verification passed with `ruff check`, `pytest -q`, and `mypy src`. Geometry, material, boundary, source, monitor, and grid tasks should extend `autofdtd.core.validation` rather than duplicating checklist-driven policy checks in each family.","next_action":"none"}
