n":"IR lowering now emits typed `ABCBoundaryIR` payloads and `BoundarySpecIR` `abc_axes` / `abc_faces` metadata."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/tests/test_boundaries.py","description":"Focused tests cover ABC normalization, compilation, staged updates, IR lowering, and the explicit `ModeABCBoundary` defer behavior."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/docs/boundaries.md","description":"Boundary documentation now explains the implemented ABC subset and the remaining `ModeABCBoundary` defer policy."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/phase1/runs/task-023-attempt-001/result.json","description":"Structured task result matching the Phase 1 output schema."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"Automatic boundary-medium inference for `ABCBoundary` and all mode-based ABC behavior should build on the new `abc_faces` staged-boundary seam once scene-material sampling and mode-solver tasks land.","next_action":"none"}
