phase1/runs/task-010-attempt-001/result.json:1:{"task_id":"task-010","status":"completed","summary":"Implemented the Phase 1 manual grid surface with typed `UniformGrid`, `CustomGrid`, `CustomGridBoundaries`, and `GridSpec` models, simulation-time grid resolution, and typed grid IR lowering with resolved boundary metadata.","key_findings":["`src/autofdtd/grid/specs.py` now provides concrete Phase 1 grid models plus `ResolvedGrid`/`ResolvedGridAxis` so simulations can resolve axis boundaries before compiler/runtime work lands.","`Simulation.resolved_grid()` and `core.validation` now enforce a strict top-level `GridSpec` contract, validate manual grid compatibility against simulation bounds, and reject planned-but-not-yet-implemented grid families like `AutoGrid` explicitly.","`src/autofdtd/ir/models.py` now lowers `GridSpec` into typed grid IR (`GridSpecIR`, per-axis IR, and resolved grid metadata), giving later discretization and mode-solver tasks an inspectable execution-side mesh contract.","Public exports, examples, and docs were updated so the grid surface is part of the Tidy3D-inspired API rather than an opaque dict payload.","Verification passed with `python -m ruff check src tests` and `python -m pytest` (47 tests passed)."],"artifacts":[{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/grid/specs.py","description":"Phase 1 manual grid models, resolution helpers, and domain-to-boundary lowering."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/core/containers.py","description":"`Simulation.resolved_grid()` integration and grid-spec validation during simulation construction."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/core/validation.py","description":"Checklist-aware normalization for `GridSpec` and explicit rejection of not-yet-implemented grid families."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/ir/models.py","description":"Typed grid execution IR and lowering path with resolved grid metadata."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/tests/test_grid.py","description":"Focused grid behavior tests covering snapping, explicit boundaries, and resolved-grid shape metrics."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/docs/grid.md","description":"Grid-scope documentation for the new Phase 1 manual discretization surface."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"The next grid task can add `AutoGrid`, refinement metadata, and related planning fields onto the existing `GridSpec`/`ResolvedGrid` seam without changing simulation or IR contracts.","next_action":"none"}
