phase1/runs/task-009-attempt-001/result.json:1:{"task_id":"task-009","status":"completed","summary":"Implemented Phase 1 repeated-placement geometry and explicit structure precedence: `GeometryArray` is now part of the public API, overlap order is surfaced as concrete metadata, arrays lower into explicit grouped instances in IR, and docs/examples/tests cover the behavior.","key_findings":["Added `GeometryArray` with Tidy3D-inspired `geometry + offsets + transforms` semantics, with Phase 1 validation that keeps transforms rigid and linear-only and reserves translation for offsets.","Made structure precedence explicit via `Scene.structure_precedence()` and `Scene.resolve_structure_stack_at_point()`, and mirrored that metadata into `StructureIR` with `source_index` and `precedence_rank`.","Lowered `GeometryArray` into ordinary grouped/transformed geometry during IR conversion instead of inventing a separate array execution primitive, keeping ordered materialization semantics consistent.","Updated docs and examples to cover repeated placement, and verified the behavior with targeted container/IR tests plus linting."],"artifacts":[{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/geometry/composite.py","description":"Added `GeometryArray` and repeated-placement expansion helpers alongside existing wrapper geometry models."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/core/containers.py","description":"Added explicit `StructurePrecedence` metadata plus scene APIs for precedence inspection and overlap stacks."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/ir/models.py","description":"Extended structure IR with precedence metadata and lowered geometry arrays into grouped instance IR."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/examples/geometry_array.py","description":"Representative repeated-placement scene exercising array placement and precedence behavior."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/docs/geometry.md","description":"Documented `GeometryArray` scope, limitations, and lowering behavior."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/tests/test_containers.py","description":"Added overlap and precedence tests for geometry arrays and explicit ordered structure stacks."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/tests/test_ir.py","description":"Added IR tests confirming geometry-array lowering and precedence metadata propagation."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/phase1/working-memory.md","description":"Recorded the geometry-array and precedence decisions for later compiler/runtime tasks."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/phase1/loop.spec.md","description":"Marked `task-009` completed in the Phase 1 task board."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"Verification run: `ruff check src tests` and `pytest -q tests/test_containers.py tests/test_ir.py`. Full-suite execution was not run.","next_action":"none"}
