phase1/runs/task-002-attempt-001/result.json:1:{"task_id":"task-002","status":"completed","summary":"Implemented the first tagged immutable container backbone for `Simulation`, `Scene`, and `Structure`, including ordered structure precedence helpers, name validation, and JSON-ready serialization scaffolding for later IR work.","key_findings":["`src/autofdtd/core/containers.py` now provides frozen pydantic container models with explicit `type` tags, JSON-ready payload helpers, and minimal disk serialization entrypoints.","`Scene` preserves ordered structure semantics and exposes `structures_in_resolution_order()` so later scene compilation can apply structures by resolved priority and insertion order without re-deriving precedence rules.","`StructurePriorityMode.CONDUCTOR` is mapped early using medium type tags so implicit priority behavior can distinguish dielectric, lossy-metal, and PEC structures before concrete material classes land.","`Simulation` now carries the Phase 1 shell fields from the feature checklist, including domain size, run time, sources, monitors, boundary and grid references, symmetry, shutoff, courant, and subpixel references.","Focused tests now cover name normalization, duplicate-name rejection, ordered overlap behavior, conductor-priority defaults, and tagged JSON serialization, and the repo passes `pytest`, `ruff`, and `mypy`."],"artifacts":[{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/core/containers.py","description":"Frozen tagged container models and precedence/serialization helpers for `Structure`, `Scene`, and `Simulation`."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/api/simulation.py","description":"Public API re-exports for the foundational container models."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/api/__init__.py","description":"API namespace exports exposing the new container backbone."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/core/__init__.py","description":"Core namespace exports exposing the tagged container layer."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/tests/test_containers.py","description":"Container-model tests for names, precedence ordering, conductor priority defaults, and JSON serialization."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/docs/architecture.md","description":"Architecture notes updated to describe the current container backbone and separation from future IR work."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/phase1/working-memory.md","description":"Condensed handoff notes capturing the container-model decisions for later tasks."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/phase1/loop.spec.md","description":"Task board updated to mark `task-002` completed."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/phase1/runs/task-002-attempt-001/result.json","description":"Recorded task output matching the Phase 1 result schema."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"`task-003` should now define the separate execution IR contract and treat the current container payload helpers as an interim handoff format rather than the final IR schema.","next_action":"none"}
