phase1/logs/console.log:323099:phase1/runs/task-001-attempt-001/result.json:1:{"task_id":"task-001","status":"completed","summary":"Created a pip-installable `src`-layout `autofdtd` package scaffold with subsystem namespaces, development tooling, a code-backed Phase 1 feature matrix, tests, and MkDocs documentation aligned to the Phase 1 feature checklist and solver subsystem boundaries.","key_findings":["The repository now has a buildable/editable package scaffold using `hatchling` in `pyproject.toml` with test, lint, type-check, and docs entrypoints.","Phase 1 feature-planning is encoded in `src/autofdtd/planning.py`, giving later tasks a local typed source for feature status and reserved namespace boundaries instead of relying only on markdown.","Subsystem namespaces are reserved up front for `api`, `core`, `geometry`, `materials`, `boundaries`, `sources`, `monitors`, `grid`, `modes`, `ir`, `compiler`, `runtime`, `kernels`, `diagnostics`, and `examples`.","A concrete install smoke target now exists via the `autofdtd-feature-matrix` CLI, which renders the packaged Phase 1 feature matrix in table or JSON form.","Validation passed for editable install, package imports, CLI tests, `pytest`, `ruff`, `mypy`, and `mkdocs build`."],"artifacts":[{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/pyproject.toml","description":"Packaging and development tooling configuration for editable installs, tests, linting, typing, and docs."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/planning.py","description":"Typed Phase 1 feature matrix and namespace plan anchored to the local Tidy3D-inspired checklist."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/cli.py","description":"CLI entrypoint exposing the packaged feature matrix for smoke testing and inspection."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/__init__.py","description":"Top-level package exports for versioning and planning metadata."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd","description":"Reserved `src`-layout package namespaces for API, IR, compiler, runtime, kernels, diagnostics, and feature families."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/mkdocs.yml","description":"MkDocs configuration for the new documentation scaffold."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/docs","description":"Documentation scaffold covering overview, architecture, feature matrix, and development entrypoints."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/tests","description":"Import, planning, and CLI smoke tests validating the scaffold."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/README.md","description":"Repository README expanded to describe package layout, quick start, and development commands."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/phase1/working-memory.md","description":"Condensed Phase 1 handoff notes recording scaffold decisions for later tasks."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"Next logical work is `task-002`: populate `autofdtd.api` and `autofdtd.core` with the tagged immutable `Simulation`, `Scene`, and `Structure` models while preserving the reserved subsystem layout established here.","next_action":"none"}
