, IR, compiler, runtime, kernels, diagnostics, and feature families."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/mkdocs.yml","description":"MkDocs configuration for the new documentation scaffold."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/docs","description":"Documentation scaffold covering overview, architecture, feature matrix, and development entrypoints."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/tests","description":"Import, planning, and CLI smoke tests validating the scaffold."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/README.md","description":"Repository README expanded to describe package layout, quick start, and development commands."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/phase1/working-memory.md","description":"Condensed Phase 1 handoff notes recording scaffold decisions for later tasks."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"Next logical work is `task-002`: populate `autofdtd.api` and `autofdtd.core` with the tagged immutable `Simulation`, `Scene`, and `Structure` models while preserving the reserved subsystem layout established here.","next_action":"none"}
