me compilation metadata for periodic, PEC, and PMC halo handling."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/kernels/boundaries.py","description":"Added concrete ghost-cell update helpers and boundary kernel metadata."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/runtime/boundaries.py","description":"Added the runtime wrapper that applies compiled boundary ghost updates."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/src/autofdtd/examples/boundaries.py","description":"Added a simple compiled-boundary example snapshot."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/docs/boundaries.md","description":"Documented the implemented subset, runtime lowering, and current limits."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/tests/test_boundaries.py","description":"Added focused tests for boundary normalization, IR lowering, compiler/runtime behavior, and explicit unsupported-boundary errors."},{"path":"/workspace/autofdtd/phase1/working-memory.md","description":"Recorded the boundary-runtime design decisions and handoff notes for later Bloch and absorber tasks."}],"error_summary":"","follow_up_notes":"Verification passed with `PYTHONPATH=src pytest -q tests/test_boundaries.py tests/test_containers.py tests/test_ir.py`, `PYTHONPATH=src pytest -q tests/test_imports.py tests/test_planning.py`, and `PYTHONPATH=src python -m compileall src`. `ruff` was not installed in the environment, so lint verification could not be run here.","next_action":"none"}
